---
import CategoryLayout from '../layouts/CategoryLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../data/site';
---

<CategoryLayout
  categoryId="image"
  title={`Free Image Tools – Compress, Resize, Convert | ${SITE.brand}`}
  description="Free image tools to compress, resize and convert JPG and PNG files. No sign-up and no upload: your photos are processed in your browser."
  h1="Free Image Tools"
>
  <h2>Fix image size and format without uploading</h2>
  <p>
    Online forms, job portals and social networks are strict about images. A form might only
    accept a photo under a certain file size, a profile picture might need to be square, and
    some sites accept JPG but not PNG. These tools handle those jobs in your browser, so your
    photos stay on your device.
  </p>
  <p>
    <a href="/compress-image">Compress Image</a> reduces file size and can aim for a target
    such as 50KB or 100KB. <a href="/resize-image">Resize Image</a> changes the width and height
    in pixels, by percentage or with a preset. <a href="/jpg-to-png">JPG to PNG</a> and
    <a href="/png-to-jpg">PNG to JPG</a> switch between the two most common formats, and let you
    pick a background color when a transparent PNG becomes a JPG.
  </p>
  <p>
    You can work with several images at once and download the results together. The tools
    work on iPhone, Android and desktop browsers with no app to install and no account to
    create, and nothing is added to your pictures.
  </p>
</CategoryLayout>
